# Git ignore

This repository is intended to support data collection, research notebooks, and local tooling. Standard exclusions are included to avoid committing generated data, environment files, and caches.

```gitignore
# Python
__pycache__/
*.py[cod]
*.pyo
*.pyd
.venv/
venv/

# Jupyter
.ipynb_checkpoints/

# Environment
.env
.env.*
.venv

# OS files
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db

# Logs
*.log

# Data caches and generated output
cache/
*.csv
*.parquet
*.sqlite
*.db

# Local build artifacts
build/
dist/
node_modules/

# IDEs
.vscode/
.idea/

# GitHub / local temp
*.tmp
*.swp
```
